# Brill: The Gravekeeper's Ledger (mod-brill-home, tools/town/grave.py), ChromieCraft's realm: Mortimer
# Weller's ledger and graves, the opened graves' evidence, the trail to the Lyle mausoleum east of town
# and the four hiding there, their things and the choice (by daylight, under their own names), the
# Magistrate's rolls and the last bell; then the four in Brill for this character (the phase
# "newcomers", 0x400000) and the choice's mark (q970305; the other, q970306, never set).
cmd .levelup 11
# Names Among the Stones: the ledgers (an option of the gravekeeper's), a grave, the rest filled.
go 0 2360.0 342.0 38.1
talk 970300
accept 970300 970300
talk 970300
select 970300 sort the burial ledgers
go 0 2352.0 324.0 36.5
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970300
cmd .quest complete 970300
go 0 2360.0 342.0 38.1
talk 970300
reward 970300 970300
# Fresh Earth: the spade in the first opened grave.
talk 970300
accept 970300 970301
go 0 2372.0 372.0 37.4
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970305
cmd .quest complete 970301
go 0 2360.0 342.0 38.1
talk 970300
reward 970300 970301
# Those Who Were Forgotten: the trail of grave dirt, then Mercy Hollin at the mausoleum (an option: the
# gravekeeper sent me), turned in to her.
talk 970300
accept 970300 970302
go 0 2425.0 302.0 36.3
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970308
go 0 2484.0 259.5 47.0
talk 970301
select 970301 not here to hurt you
cmd .quest complete 970302
talk 970301
reward 970301 970302
# A Name of One's Own: Gideon's tool roll by the old smithy, then the choice: by daylight.
talk 970301
accept 970301 970303
go 0 2042.5 154.5 34.3
cmd .brilltown use
expect Brill town: used 970310
go 0 2484.0 259.5 47.0
talk 970301
select 970301 by daylight
cmd .quest complete 970303
talk 970301
reward 970301 970303
# The Last Bell: Magistrate Sevren's rolls, the bell (the gravekeeper's option), turned in to him.
talk 970301
accept 970301 970304
go 0 2304.0 266.5 38.8
talk 1499
select 1499 four names be entered
go 0 2360.0 342.0 38.1
talk 970300
select 970300 Ring the bell
talk 970300
reward 970300 970304
# The four in Brill for this character, and the daylight choice's mark alone.
wait 2
cmd .brilltown state
has [0x400000]
has q970304 q970305
expect-not q970306
# Mercy Hollin in Brill (the phase's): there to talk to by the cemetery.
go 0 2354.0 337.0 38.1
wait 2
talk 970305
